htgt6.wiki.article.forging.title=Forging
htgt6.wiki.article.forging.p1=To forge material in GT6, you need an anvil and a hammer, but simply hitting the anvil is not enough.
htgt6.wiki.article.forging.p2=Place the item or items on the anvil. Hitting the middle part selects the regular straight-forging recipe.
htgt6.wiki.article.forging.p3=The left and right sides are used for forging in a small or large anvil. The recipe depends on which side you strike.
htgt6.wiki.article.forging.p4=The anvil can also crush ore into dust and create several material blanks.
htgt6.wiki.article.forging.warning=And for goodness' sake, do not make a stone anvil!
